{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to our Demo Page! Actually you will have a pretty good taste about the game after playing it since the the section you will play will be a &quot;little&quot; part of the full game!<br><br>Compared to full version,\u00a0There will be fewer obstacle types, mini-games, easter eggs, map variety, and of course, shorter playtime!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Hope you will like it!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Have fun and create painfully good memories!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>If you want to learn more;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/c422651e51a51c5f285f54e30fc85e64.avif?t=1758108447\" width=856 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/18358de93ffd910e75a72305469d4c9a.poster.avif?t=1758108447\" width=642 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/18358de93ffd910e75a72305469d4c9a.webm?t=1758108447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/18358de93ffd910e75a72305469d4c9a.mp4?t=1758108447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a canoe and control it at the same time. SHOUT, PANIC, MISCOMMUNICATE, OVERSTEER, and somehow still move forward, together. The ultimate test for your friendship is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/05c04daf3d4318f879aeab3993d75ebf.avif?t=1758108447\" width=856 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/f7e6433b16abde121e943407d9fabc7c.poster.avif?t=1758108447\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/f7e6433b16abde121e943407d9fabc7c.webm?t=1758108447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a peaceful river ride. It\u2019s physics-based multiplayer MADNESS where every second counts. HIT every rock, SCREAM through every turn, and FLIP OVER when it matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/9c188446f35f5367ac4534ccd1ca119c.avif?t=1758108447\" width=856 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/02726ed05215b1f91b2c09ea4db5a2d8.poster.avif?t=1758108447\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/02726ed05215b1f91b2c09ea4db5a2d8.webm?t=1758108447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, there\u2019s a baby. And yes, YOU ARE RESPONSIBLE. Paddle through rapids, rocks, and sheer panic while desperately trying not to flip the boat and launch the poor thing into oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/7a93444eb43e3aaf4840d682519817d7.avif?t=1758108447\" width=856 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/42fdc455f914e51bde2132d38deccedf.poster.avif?t=1758108447\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/42fdc455f914e51bde2132d38deccedf.webm?t=1758108447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/extras/42fdc455f914e51bde2132d38deccedf.mp4?t=1758108447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome wildly different challenges, dodge unpredictable obstacles, and try to finish the course without flying, falling, or fully losing your mind. Be warned: every turn hides a new surprise and YOU ARE ABSOLUTELY NOT READY FOR IT.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997230?t=1758108447","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997230?t=1758108447","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/9d0dc340cfd1ee7f68be8feeb99f8ba9bd3a3f12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758108447","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997230/9d0dc340cfd1ee7f68be8feeb99f8ba9bd3a3f12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758108447","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"des